# _CI — workflow task runner

This directory carries the {{ project_name }} workflow tooling: a task runner
written against the Node standard library only, so it works before
`pnpm install` has ever run.

- `workflow.mjs` — the dispatcher behind `./workflow.cmd`
- `tasks/` — one module per namespace (`format`, `lint`, `test`, `build`,
  `quality`, `secure`, `release`, `document`, `container`, `develop`,
  `bootstrap`)
- `tasks/configuration.mjs` — centralized constants
- `tasks/shared.mjs` — process execution, logging, and platform helpers

Add a task by exporting a function from the matching module and registering it
in that module's `namespace` object. Add a namespace by creating a module and
registering it in `tasks/index.mjs`.
